	(text "ALERT is unconnected because if the board \ngets hot enough for it to assert, then\nit is already over.\n\nAssignments are binary 0-5. We don't do addressing\n based on SCL/SDA as TI has strange\ntiming requirements which can lead to \nmiassignments during startup."
